('single-cell-analysis', 'Single-cell analysis', 'Measurements resolved to an individual cell or lineage rather than only a pooled average. Maintaining identity across images, division events and recovery is essential; repeated frames are not independent biological samples [1].', '/blog/single-cell-microalgae-microfluidics', 'Tracking and validation limitations'),
